<td id="S4.T2.6.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.6.6.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:199.2pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.6.6.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T2.6.6.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">All ranks reduce </span><math id="S4.T2.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.T2.6.6.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> elements; each rank receives a portion of </span><math id="S4.T2.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N/\text{nranks}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mtext mathsize="0.900em">nranks</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N/\text{nranks}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.T2.6.6.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.6.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.6.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">ncclGather</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;"><math id="S4.T2.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;"><math id="S4.T2.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N\times\text{nranks}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext mathsize="0.900em">nranks</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N\times\text{nranks}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.T2.6.7.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> (root)</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.6.7.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:199.2pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.6.7.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T2.6.7.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Each rank sends </span><math id="S4.T2.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.T2.6.7.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> elements to the root which gathers all data.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.6.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.6.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">ncclScatter</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;"><math id="S4.T2.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N\times\text{nranks}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext mathsize="0.900em">nranks</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N\times\text{nranks}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.T2.6.8.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> (root)</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;"><math id="S4.T2.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.8.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.6.8.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:199.2pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.6.8.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T2.6.8.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Root scatters </span><math id="S4.T2.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.T2.6.8.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> elements to other ranks from its buffer of the size </span><math id="S4.T2.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N\times\text{nranks}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext mathsize="0.900em">nranks</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N\times\text{nranks}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.T2.6.8.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.6.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.6.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;"><span id="S4.T2.6.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">ncclAllToAll</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;"><math id="S4.T2.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;"><math id="S4.T2.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S4.T2.6.9.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.6.9.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:199.2pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.6.9.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T2.6.9.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Each rank sends </span><math id="S4.T2.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N/\text{nranks}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mtext mathsize="0.900em">nranks</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N/\text{nranks}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.T2.6.9.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> elements to every other rank and receives the same from each.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Scalability test.</span> We employ an emulation-based approach to conduct the scalability evaluation because of limited accesses to hardware. Specifically, we develop an emulator that reproduces system performance as the number of nodes is scaled. In this emulator, we assume that concurrent read or write requests targeting the same CXL device share the available bandwidth uniformly, aligned with the results presented in Section <a href="#S2.SS3" title="2.3. Performance Characteristic of CXL Shared Memory Pool ‣ 2. Background ‣ CCCL: Node-Spanning GPU Collectives with CXL Memory Pooling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2.3</span></a>.
Requests directed to different CXL devices are assumed to be mutually independent, i.e., no performance interference is modeled across devices. The emulator is configured to employ a total of six CXL devices.</p>
</div>
